
A vim plugin for a little bit of syntax highlighting.

There are quite a number of vim plugin managers. If you are using vim-plug[1],
the incantation will look like this:

    Plug 'cakemanny/structlang', { 'rtp': 'vim' }

Hopefully your plugin manager is able to do something similar.

[1]: https://github.com/junegunn/vim-plug
